        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we have numerous United States and foreign patents covering certain of our products and manufacturing processes, no particular patent is considered individually material to our business.",
        "start_character": 37040,
        "end_character": 37235
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Competition in the markets where we sell the bulk of our products is extremely fragmented, both geographically and by application.",
        "start_character": 33507,
        "end_character": 33637
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the past several years, we incurred restructuring expense related to closing and downsizing of facilities as part of the manufacturing transitions of our load cell products to facilities in India, which marked key milestones in our ongoing strategic initiatives to align and consolidate our manufacturing footprint.",
        "start_character": 7960,
        "end_character": 8278
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the past few years, we have seen a broadening of precision sensing applications in both our traditional industrial markets and new markets, due to the development of higher functionality in our customers' end products.",
        "start_character": 1166,
        "end_character": 1389
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To that end, we expect to sustain or increase our R&D expenditures in order to fill the product development pipeline and lay the foundation for future sales growth.",
        "start_character": 36565,
        "end_character": 36729
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also maintain research and development staff, and promote programs at a number of our production facilities to develop new products and new applications of existing products, and to improve manufacturing techniques.",
        "start_character": 35380,
        "end_character": 35598
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also use distributors and sales agents, as appropriate, to market, sell, and support certain products in this segment.",
        "start_character": 24009,
        "end_character": 24130
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe this unique foil technology will create new markets as customers “design in” these next generation products in existing and new applications.",
        "start_character": 6880,
        "end_character": 7032
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect to continue to use our research and development, engineering, and product marketing resources to introduce new and innovative specialty products.",
        "start_character": 9077,
        "end_character": 9232
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to leverage our insights into customer demand to continually develop and roll out new, innovative products within our existing lines and to modify our existing core products in ways that make them more appealing, addressing changing customer needs and industry trends in terms of form, fit, and function.",
        "start_character": 9716,
        "end_character": 10030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We maintain strategically placed design centers for each of our business segments where proximity to customers enables us to more easily monitor and satisfy the needs of local markets.",
        "start_character": 35076,
        "end_character": 35260
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-005982",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-005982-8ed7ce7e2be87ec2",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-005982",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manufacture both standardized products and those designed and produced to meet customer specifications.",
        "start_character": 31112,
        "end_character": 31218
      }
